# TypeScript's incremental-build state. These were TRACKED, so every build
# rewrote them and they showed up as modified in every `git status` — noise in
# every diff, and one more thing to accidentally commit. (`dist/` above already
# covers the build output itself.)
*.tsbuildinfo
